MUSIC / SOUND
Entirely original deterministic procedural synthesis. Lute-like string plucks, harmonic bowed tones, workshop air, engraving scratches, paper opening, wind and water sounds. No commercial music, recorded samples, generated voice service or external audio asset. The synthetic timbres are not represented as recordings of real instruments.

TOOLS
Native Skia Canvas via the already installed @napi-rs/canvas; Node.js; Python; NumPy; SciPy; Pillow; FFmpeg. Source is supplied, but these system dependencies are not bundled. No paid generation or RunningHub charge. Public gallery inclusion authorized by the owner.

